usage: qualify.py [-h] --gradient-build GRADIENT_BUILD
                  --adam-distribution-build ADAM_DISTRIBUTION_BUILD --compiler
                  COMPILER --linker LINKER --output OUTPUT

Cold-build combined owned HIA and run the separate frozen execution suites.
This qualifier never installs or simulates Torch. It replays immutable hosted
observations and runs independent native controls. The suite counts remain
separate, including legacy transaction/state differences and unrepresented
APIs. Independent peer compiler/entry/handoff and mixed2/scalar48 gates are
separate.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --gradient-build GRADIENT_BUILD
  --adam-distribution-build ADAM_DISTRIBUTION_BUILD
  --compiler COMPILER
  --linker LINKER
  --output OUTPUT
